 are very  different i think they both have  attributes that are just absolutely  amazing you know good food is universal  and i'm so glad that i got to have this  experience and that i got to share it  with all of you thanks for visiting  brianna it seems like you learned a lot  about my home and my cuisine while  you're here i hope you enjoyed your  journey through this food and fog filled  city please come back anytime  [Music]  hi chanel welcome to la i can't wait for  you to check out some of my favorite  go-to spots  [Music]  you
 

